    {
      "id": "fba74852",
      "name": "Fleet Target Sweep (3 Drones)",
      "content": "Three-drone target sweep: Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2 take off together to 18 meters altitude. Drone 1 flies to target Polygon Target 2, Drone 3 flies to target Polygon Target 3, and Drone 2 flies to target Polygon Target 1. After reaching the targets, all three drones move west for 87m, then south for 83m, then north for 58m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 87m, south 83m, north 58m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
