        "Coordinate Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2: ascend together to 18 meters altitude, send Drone 1 to target Polygon Target 2, Drone 3 to target Polygon Target 3, and Drone 2 to target Polygon Target 1, then execute coordinated sweep movement west 87m, south 83m, and north 58m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (west 87m, south 83m, north 58m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
        "Three-drone target sweep operation: launch Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2 to altitude 18m, navigate to targets Polygon Target 2, Polygon Target 3, Polygon Target 1 respectively, then shift west by 87 meters, south by 83 meters, and north by 58 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
        "Execute three-drone sweep mission: Drone 1, Drone 3, Drone 2 take off reaching 18 meters height, fly to targets Polygon Target 2, Polygon Target 3, Polygon Target 1 respectively, then proceed west for 87m, subsequently south for 83m, and finally north for 58m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
        "Three-drone coordinated target mission: Drone 1, Drone 3, and Drone 2 lift off to 18m elevation, reach targets Polygon Target 2, Polygon Target 3, Polygon Target 1 respectively, then travel west 87 meters, south 83 meters, and north 58 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
