    "name": "Fleet Coordinated Takeoff and Formation (4 Drones) 2",
    "content": "Four-drone coordination exercise: Drone 2, Drone 2, Drone 3, and Drone 1 take off together to 23 meters altitude, then hold formation at positions (488, 460, 23), (599, 515, 23), (576, 558, 23), and (454, 637, 23) respectively for synchronized operation. Then all four drones move north for 67m, and next move east for 60m. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (north 67m, then east 60m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
    "content_aliases": [
      "Coordinate Drone 2, Drone 2, Drone 3, and Drone 1: ascend together to 23 meters, establish square formation at positions (488, 460, 23), (599, 515, 23), (576, 558, 23), and (454, 637, 23) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 67m followed by east 60m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 67m, east 60m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Four-drone formation drill: launch Drone 2, Drone 2, Drone 3, and Drone 1 to altitude 23m, hold stations at (488, 460, 23), (599, 515, 23), (576, 558, 23), and (454, 637, 23) respectively, then shift north by 67 meters and east by 60 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute synchronized operation with Drone 2, Drone 2, Drone 3, Drone 1: take off reaching 23 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (488, 460, 23), (599, 515, 23), (576, 558, 23), and (454, 637, 23) respectively, then proceed north for 67m and subsequently east for 60m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Four-drone coordinated maneuver: Drone 2, Drone 2, Drone 3, and Drone 1 lift off to 23m elevation, hold formation positions at (488, 460, 23), (599, 515, 23), (576, 558, 23), and (454, 637, 23) respectively, then travel north 67 meters and east 60 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
    ],
